k</code> and a subkey description <code>ctx</code>.</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">expand</span>(out: []<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, ctx: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, prk: [<a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/crypto/hkdf/#std.crypto.hkdf.Hkdf.prk_length\">prk_length</a>]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code></pre>\n<h4>Parameters</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>out: []<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span></code></pre>\n<pre><code>ctx: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span></code></pre>\n<pre><code>prk: [<a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/crypto/hkdf/#std.crypto.hkdf.Hkdf.prk_length\">prk_length</a>]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.crypto.hkdf.Hkdf.extract\"><h3><code>std.crypto.hkdf.Hkdf.extract</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">function</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L20\">Source line 20</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>Return a master key from a salt and initial keying material.</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">extract</span>(salt: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, ikm: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>) [<a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/crypto/hkdf/#std.crypto.hkdf.Hkdf.prk_length\">prk_length</a>]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span></code></pre>\n<h4>Parameters</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>salt: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span></code></pre>\n<pre><code>ikm: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\"